(7234863, 1120308, 116730, '<td valign="top">This is absolutely beautiful! My favorite for this challenge. The lighting through the bridge with the mountains and all perfectly sharp. 10.</td>', 'This is absolutely beautiful! My favorite for this challenge. The lighting through the bridge with the mountains and all perfectly sharp. 10.', '2014-07-01 01:32:29.000000', NULL, 1),
