(7234886, 1120575, 96751, '<td valign="top">Beautiful light, I like the claustrophobia of the small room. Just wish his right foot wasn''t torqued in...</td>', 'Beautiful light, I like the claustrophobia of the small room. Just wish his right foot wasn''t torqued in...', '2014-07-01 03:43:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7234889, 1117501, 96751, '<td valign="top">Delicious light and tones.  Reminds me of Paul''s lovely work.</td>', 'Delicious light and tones.  Reminds me of Paul''s lovely work.', '2014-07-01 03:44:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7234890, 1120700, 96751, '<td valign="top">HEY!!!!!! Great to see your mug again :)</td>', 'HEY!!!!!! Great to see your mug again :)', '2014-07-01 03:45:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7234891, 1120035, 96751, '<td valign="top">Hahaha!  The look on that guy''s face complete''s the shot</td>', 'Hahaha!  The look on that guy''s face complete''s the shot', '2014-07-01 03:46:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7234894, 1120768, 176067, '<td valign="top">Nice composition with good proportion of the sky to the sea.  The 3 boats off to the right make it a little unbalanced, and the exposure is maybe over by one stop.  I really like the leading line of the deck to the framing of the hut at the end.  And it makes me want to be there, a real slice of paradise.</td>', 'Nice composition with good proportion of the sky to the sea.  The 3 boats off to the right make it a little unbalanced, and the exposure is maybe over by one stop.  I really like the leading line of the deck to the framing of the hut at the end.  And it makes me want to be there, a real slice of paradise.', '2014-07-01 04:14:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7234897, 1119772, 176067, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot, I like the proportion of water to sky, making the reflection completely in view.  The lighting in the trees on the right needs to be toned down a little as my eye keeps going to it.  I love the night sky, and the blue reflection coming off the deck looks awesome, I really like night shots like this.</td>', 'Very nice shot, I like the proportion of water to sky, making the reflection completely in view.  The lighting in the trees on the right needs to be toned down a little as my eye keeps going to it.  I love the night sky, and the blue reflection coming off the deck looks awesome, I really like night shots like this.', '2014-07-01 04:30:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7234898, 1120646, 176067, '<td valign="top">Great focus and detail on the back of the insect.  I do like to see the eyes of the subject having its back to us it makes them hard to see.  I do like the composition and placing, the colour is amazing, and the depth of field is spot on.</td>', 'Great focus and detail on the back of the insect.  I do like to see the eyes of the subject having its back to us it makes them hard to see.  I do like the composition and placing, the colour is amazing, and the depth of field is spot on.', '2014-07-01 04:35:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7234900, 1120144, 176067, '<td valign="top">I like the movement of this shot, great choice going for B&amp;W, the water movement adds real drama to the shot.</td>', 'I like the movement of this shot, great choice going for B&W, the water movement adds real drama to the shot.', '2014-07-01 04:42:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7234901, 1118250, 176067, '<td valign="top">Great lighting, I like the soft edge to the shadows and the tones of the shot.  The expression on her face looks great too.</td>', 'Great lighting, I like the soft edge to the shadows and the tones of the shot.  The expression on her face looks great too.', '2014-07-01 04:47:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7234902, 1120309, 176067, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, great expression on his face, his eyes lead me off into the distance and wonder what he is aiming at.</td>', 'Nice composition, great expression on his face, his eyes lead me off into the distance and wonder what he is aiming at.', '2014-07-01 04:50:23.000000', NULL, 1),
