(7234913, 1118974, 176067, '<td valign="top">Nicely done, the focus on the bike, while the rest of the shot is moving is spot on.  I also like the space left in front of the bike too.</td>', 'Nicely done, the focus on the bike, while the rest of the shot is moving is spot on.  I also like the space left in front of the bike too.', '2014-07-01 05:39:16.000000', NULL, 1),
