(7235035, 1120567, 47906, '<td valign="top">Such a nice shot of a puffin, I love these little guys. Excellent detail in the feathers and face. Great use of DOF to isolate the Puffin. Love the use of frame and overall composition of the photo. Good Luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Such a nice shot of a puffin, I love these little guys. Excellent detail in the feathers and face. Great use of DOF to isolate the Puffin. Love the use of frame and overall composition of the photo. Good Luck in the challenge.', '2014-07-01 11:12:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7235037, 1119664, 47906, '<td valign="top">this makes me dizzy just looking at it. Great capture of motion! Seems like the sky is a bit pushed / noisy. Good Shot and Framing regardless.</td>', 'this makes me dizzy just looking at it. Great capture of motion! Seems like the sky is a bit pushed / noisy. Good Shot and Framing regardless.', '2014-07-01 11:14:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7235038, 1120564, 47906, '<td valign="top">Love the rolling fields and the lighting across them. Took me a second after studying it to notice the person in the lower right of the frame. Has a really nice texture to it. Makes me want to touch it. Beautiful.</td>', 'Love the rolling fields and the lighting across them. Took me a second after studying it to notice the person in the lower right of the frame. Has a really nice texture to it. Makes me want to touch it. Beautiful.', '2014-07-01 11:16:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7235039, 1120381, 47906, '<td valign="top">I really love the warm feeling of the tones in this. The positioning of the rocks in the foreground are nice for your composition but the horizon being close to the center may be hurting this a bit, I would try cropping a bit off the sky to make it a bit more dynamic.<br/> <br/> Also be careful of oversharpening, if you look at the rock on the right side of the frame you can see a slight halo about it. <br/> <br/>Nice photo overall, good luck in the challenge. 7</td>', 'I really love the warm feeling of the tones in this. The positioning of the rocks in the foreground are nice for your composition but the horizon being close to the center may be hurting this a bit, I would try cropping a bit off the sky to make it a bit more dynamic.  Also be careful of oversharpening, if you look at the rock on the right side of the frame you can see a slight halo about it.  Nice photo overall, good luck in the challenge. 7', '2014-07-01 11:20:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7235040, 1120671, 47906, '<td valign="top">I laughed when I saw this shot, It really does feel like this sometimes when you are playing...<br/> <br/>Excellent vast landscape, great positioning of your model. Lovely clouds! Cant really see the golf club well at 800 pixels unfortunately. I am sure this would look great in a larger size.</td>', 'I laughed when I saw this shot, It really does feel like this sometimes when you are playing... Excellent vast landscape, great positioning of your model. Lovely clouds! Cant really see the golf club well at 800 pixels unfortunately. I am sure this would look great in a larger size.', '2014-07-01 11:25:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7235043, 1120139, 47906, '<td valign="top">I love the depth that you have captured in the frame. The yellow flowers in the foreground it really gives your eye something to look at in every area of the frame. <br/> <br/>I really love the fog coming in across the bridge as well. Nice Shot!</td>', 'I love the depth that you have captured in the frame. The yellow flowers in the foreground it really gives your eye something to look at in every area of the frame.  I really love the fog coming in across the bridge as well. Nice Shot!', '2014-07-01 11:29:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7235045, 1120722, 47906, '<td valign="top">I really like the perspective that you were going for in this. Great contrast from the sky and clarity overall. <br/> <br/>Might go back if you can and see if you can catch the flowers in the foreground in a full bloom up near the top of the stalk.</td>', 'I really like the perspective that you were going for in this. Great contrast from the sky and clarity overall.  Might go back if you can and see if you can catch the flowers in the foreground in a full bloom up near the top of the stalk.', '2014-07-01 11:34:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7235047, 1120764, 47906, '<td valign="top">Love the detail of this shot! looks great with the shallow DOF, makes me want to blow all the seedlings away. Great shot!</td>', 'Love the detail of this shot! looks great with the shallow DOF, makes me want to blow all the seedlings away. Great shot!', '2014-07-01 11:37:04.000000', NULL, 1),
