(7237062, 1120454, 60495, '<td valign="top">I found when I first looked at this image I was not sure what the intended focal point of the image was supposed to be. I like the water, the mountains, and the clouds, but the cows to me just seem to be in the way. It might be because the cow on the bottom was partially cut off that makes the image seem awkward. There is also some sort of debris near the bottom on the left I think should have been removed. I think for the cows to be included shooting from a lower POV would help, even shooting from the ground up which creates a more interesting angle and would elevate the cows to include the in the background.  Hope the info helps, good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I found when I first looked at this image I was not sure what the intended focal point of the image was supposed to be. I like the water, the mountains, and the clouds, but the cows to me just seem to be in the way. It might be because the cow on the bottom was partially cut off that makes the image seem awkward. There is also some sort of debris near the bottom on the left I think should have been removed. I think for the cows to be included shooting from a lower POV would help, even shooting from the ground up which creates a more interesting angle and would elevate the cows to include the in the background.  Hope the info helps, good luck in the challenge.', '2014-07-05 21:39:23.000000', NULL, 1),
