(7237431, 1119871, 83313, '<td valign="top">Females of tribe are taut at young age to help with cavework. Favurite female youngling of Grog is seen with handy tool on hed for cleaning cave ceeling of soot from fire. Is grate new invenchun of Grog. (Pat pending.)</td>', 'Females of tribe are taut at young age to help with cavework. Favurite female youngling of Grog is seen with handy tool on hed for cleaning cave ceeling of soot from fire. Is grate new invenchun of Grog. (Pat pending.)', '2014-07-06 22:46:31.000000', NULL, 1),
