(7237672, 1120405, 176157, '<td valign="top">This is very nice.</td>', 'This is very nice.', '2014-07-07 06:39:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7237673, 1120671, 131284, '<td valign="top">That must be one long drive!</td>', 'That must be one long drive!', '2014-07-07 06:54:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7237674, 1119866, 131284, '<td valign="top">Never thought about it before, but this is the first time I''ve seen a shot like this. Very interesting.</td>', 'Never thought about it before, but this is the first time I''ve seen a shot like this. Very interesting.', '2014-07-07 06:54:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7237675, 1120730, 176157, '<td valign="top">This is awesome.  Nice everything:  colors, arrangement, scene.</td>', 'This is awesome.  Nice everything:  colors, arrangement, scene.', '2014-07-07 06:55:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7237676, 1120615, 131284, '<td valign="top">Nice bovine portrait :).</td>', 'Nice bovine portrait :).', '2014-07-07 06:56:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7237677, 1120615, 176157, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  A little intimidating.</td>', 'Very nice.  A little intimidating.', '2014-07-07 06:56:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7237678, 1119676, 119419, '<td valign="top">Bella</td>', 'Bella', '2014-07-07 07:01:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7237679, 1120308, 131284, '<td valign="top">My pick for the red; great picture. The only issue for me is the bridge feels a little crooked (maybe it is?), a few steps to the left to get the rear support perfectly lined up with the front support would have helped.</td>', 'My pick for the red; great picture. The only issue for me is the bridge feels a little crooked (maybe it is?), a few steps to the left to get the rear support perfectly lined up with the front support would have helped.', '2014-07-07 07:06:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7237680, 1120165, 176157, '<td valign="top">Very cool and a clever composition</td>', 'Very cool and a clever composition', '2014-07-07 07:07:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7237681, 1119342, 131284, '<td valign="top">Excellent! Fantastically abstract landscape that could almost pass as a microscopic image. My pick for the blue and my only 9.</td>', 'Excellent! Fantastically abstract landscape that could almost pass as a microscopic image. My pick for the blue and my only 9.', '2014-07-07 07:08:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7237682, 1120687, 131284, '<td valign="top">Nice serene landscape.</td>', 'Nice serene landscape.', '2014-07-07 07:08:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7237683, 1120247, 131284, '<td valign="top">Nice fun expressions, but sorry the processing is a bit too much on this one for me; they look like they both need a wash.</td>', 'Nice fun expressions, but sorry the processing is a bit too much on this one for me; they look like they both need a wash.', '2014-07-07 07:11:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7237685, 1120524, 176157, '<td valign="top">nice timing and composition - and color.</td>', 'nice timing and composition - and color.', '2014-07-07 07:12:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7237686, 1120257, 176157, '<td valign="top">Great title.  Is the barn still standing?</td>', 'Great title.  Is the barn still standing?', '2014-07-07 07:13:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7237687, 1120574, 131284, '<td valign="top">The note on the middle post box is just too small to read, I don''t know if this is significant or not but I find it a distracting. I also think there needs to be more going on in the scene, and perhaps not an entirely symmetrical composition like this, which is currently emphasising the distortion from the wide angle lens you used.</td>', 'The note on the middle post box is just too small to read, I don''t know if this is significant or not but I find it a distracting. I also think there needs to be more going on in the scene, and perhaps not an entirely symmetrical composition like this, which is currently emphasising the distortion from the wide angle lens you used.', '2014-07-07 07:16:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7237688, 1118315, 176157, '<td valign="top">Little handsome man.</td>', 'Little handsome man.', '2014-07-07 07:16:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7237689, 1116936, 131284, '<td valign="top">I think this image would do better if it were sharper. Was the tripod a little unstable?</td>', 'I think this image would do better if it were sharper. Was the tripod a little unstable?', '2014-07-07 07:17:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7237690, 1118469, 176157, '<td valign="top">That''s amazing. He looks a little angry.</td>', 'That''s amazing. He looks a little angry.', '2014-07-07 07:17:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7237691, 1117502, 131284, '<td valign="top">Sorry, the processing is too much for me here. It just looks gaudy and unreal.</td>', 'Sorry, the processing is too much for me here. It just looks gaudy and unreal.', '2014-07-07 07:18:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7237692, 1120729, 131284, '<td valign="top">I think a ball or similar in the frame would help a lot, without one for reference the scene''s a little confused I feel. I also accept that you have to work within the limitations of your equipment, but the grain is quite distracting, perhaps more could be done to remove it in post?</td>', 'I think a ball or similar in the frame would help a lot, without one for reference the scene''s a little confused I feel. I also accept that you have to work within the limitations of your equipment, but the grain is quite distracting, perhaps more could be done to remove it in post?', '2014-07-07 07:21:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7237693, 1115207, 176157, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of the movie "Raise the red Lantern"  Very nice.</td>', 'Reminds me of the movie "Raise the red Lantern"  Very nice.', '2014-07-07 07:21:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7237694, 1118852, 131284, '<td valign="top">Processing is fine except with this scene I feel it makes everything blend in a bit too much. I can see it''s a tree in some woodland, but it''s not the easiest thing to make out and I''m not quite sure why I''m being shown it, sorry.</td>', 'Processing is fine except with this scene I feel it makes everything blend in a bit too much. I can see it''s a tree in some woodland, but it''s not the easiest thing to make out and I''m not quite sure why I''m being shown it, sorry.', '2014-07-07 07:22:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7237695, 1119664, 131284, '<td valign="top">Just way, way, way over processed, sorry. The image I''m sure would have looked a lot better without any processing.</td>', 'Just way, way, way over processed, sorry. The image I''m sure would have looked a lot better without any processing.', '2014-07-07 07:24:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7237696, 1120002, 131284, '<td valign="top">Too much processing. I think there''s a trend to try to make images look more exciting by putting them through an HDR process. It just doesn''t work for me, sorry.</td>', 'Too much processing. I think there''s a trend to try to make images look more exciting by putting them through an HDR process. It just doesn''t work for me, sorry.', '2014-07-07 07:26:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7237697, 1120707, 176157, '<td valign="top">This is nice</td>', 'This is nice', '2014-07-07 07:26:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7237698, 1119674, 131284, '<td valign="top">Sorry, I''m not keen on the HDR-like processing. I think the scene is lacking too; the architecture (from this pov) isn''t interesting enough to stand on its own, and there is nothing else happening in the scene to draw my eye.</td>', 'Sorry, I''m not keen on the HDR-like processing. I think the scene is lacking too; the architecture (from this pov) isn''t interesting enough to stand on its own, and there is nothing else happening in the scene to draw my eye.', '2014-07-07 07:28:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7237699, 1120752, 176157, '<td valign="top">Good Title...</td>', 'Good Title...', '2014-07-07 07:29:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7237700, 1120605, 131284, '<td valign="top">Looks like the clarity slider got stuck, sorry. The scene would be a lot better with less severe processing; as it stands, it doesn''t look remotely real. A shame as clearly the buildings are interesting and in an interesting location.</td>', 'Looks like the clarity slider got stuck, sorry. The scene would be a lot better with less severe processing; as it stands, it doesn''t look remotely real. A shame as clearly the buildings are interesting and in an interesting location.', '2014-07-07 07:30:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7237701, 1119885, 176157, '<td valign="top">Its nice</td>', 'Its nice', '2014-07-07 07:30:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7237703, 1118953, 176157, '<td valign="top">Looks like a painting.  Thats very nice how you did that.</td>', 'Looks like a painting.  Thats very nice how you did that.', '2014-07-07 07:32:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7237704, 1119949, 131284, '<td valign="top">I think when photographing an object the frame should be set up to give maximum impact, perhaps showing the object in relation to its environment, or a close up for a more abstract feel. If it''s a straight on shot then the photograph only becomes a lesser representation of the object featured and since this is a photography competition I can''t give marks for just being shown an interesting object, sorry.</td>', 'I think when photographing an object the frame should be set up to give maximum impact, perhaps showing the object in relation to its environment, or a close up for a more abstract feel. If it''s a straight on shot then the photograph only becomes a lesser representation of the object featured and since this is a photography competition I can''t give marks for just being shown an interesting object, sorry.', '2014-07-07 07:34:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7237706, 1119342, 176157, '<td valign="top">Interesting.</td>', 'Interesting.', '2014-07-07 07:35:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7237707, 1118953, 131284, '<td valign="top">An interesting scene ruined by severe processing, sorry. This hyper-real HDR-look just makes everything appear gaudy and unreal; subtlety is the key!</td>', 'An interesting scene ruined by severe processing, sorry. This hyper-real HDR-look just makes everything appear gaudy and unreal; subtlety is the key!', '2014-07-07 07:37:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7237710, 1120730, 131284, '<td valign="top">It''s a rather common scene on DPC so I find this image a little less interesting than I otherwise would. Still, I won''t mark down for that and the framing is nice. Just a touch over-saturated for my taste.</td>', 'It''s a rather common scene on DPC so I find this image a little less interesting than I otherwise would. Still, I won''t mark down for that and the framing is nice. Just a touch over-saturated for my taste.', '2014-07-07 07:48:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7237711, 1120747, 131284, '<td valign="top">To me the processing makes the scene look dark and ominous, definitely not a paradise.</td>', 'To me the processing makes the scene look dark and ominous, definitely not a paradise.', '2014-07-07 07:52:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7237713, 1120583, 131284, '<td valign="top">A slight levels adjustment would have really made this pop a lot more and gotten this image higher marks I''m sure. Processing is important :).</td>', 'A slight levels adjustment would have really made this pop a lot more and gotten this image higher marks I''m sure. Processing is important :).', '2014-07-07 07:53:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7237714, 1120280, 156466, '<td valign="top">Nice capture and colors.  I like the circular feel of the clouds around the balloon, but the overall composition is awkward - balloon is too low and centered in the frame.</td>', 'Nice capture and colors.  I like the circular feel of the clouds around the balloon, but the overall composition is awkward - balloon is too low and centered in the frame.', '2014-07-07 08:28:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7237717, 1120605, 156466, '<td valign="top">Shadows a little too dark in the foreground, highlights a little blown out in the middle left, but otherwise a lovely shot. 7</td>', 'Shadows a little too dark in the foreground, highlights a little blown out in the middle left, but otherwise a lovely shot. 7', '2014-07-07 08:34:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7237719, 1120463, 156466, '<td valign="top">Really interesting photo.  I''m trying to wrap my head around how you got the series of reflections in a single photo without carrying a piece of glass around with you - which you very well may have done.  If so, bravo.</td>', 'Really interesting photo.  I''m trying to wrap my head around how you got the series of reflections in a single photo without carrying a piece of glass around with you - which you very well may have done.  If so, bravo.', '2014-07-07 08:40:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7237720, 1117076, 156466, '<td valign="top">Interesting title, allowing for the line that otherwise distracts the heck out of me.</td>', 'Interesting title, allowing for the line that otherwise distracts the heck out of me.', '2014-07-07 08:41:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7237721, 1116941, 156466, '<td valign="top">Seems OOF or suffering from movement.</td>', 'Seems OOF or suffering from movement.', '2014-07-07 08:42:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7237722, 1118315, 156466, '<td valign="top">Would have been better had he been looking at the camera, or less just above and to the left.  Otherwise, cute as heck.</td>', 'Would have been better had he been looking at the camera, or less just above and to the left.  Otherwise, cute as heck.', '2014-07-07 08:44:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7237723, 1120564, 156466, '<td valign="top">Took me a while before I noticed the person.  Took this from a 7 to an 8 with the feel for size and scope.  Nice shot.</td>', 'Took me a while before I noticed the person.  Took this from a 7 to an 8 with the feel for size and scope.  Nice shot.', '2014-07-07 08:45:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7237724, 1120405, 156466, '<td valign="top">Love the colors, but not the final lines.  A touch of vertical perspective correction to get the lines in the window and frame to run parallel to the image edges and this is an 8 for me.  As is it''s a 6.</td>', 'Love the colors, but not the final lines.  A touch of vertical perspective correction to get the lines in the window and frame to run parallel to the image edges and this is an 8 for me.  As is it''s a 6.', '2014-07-07 08:49:55.000000', NULL, 1),
