(7237732, 1120308, 156466, '<td valign="top">This is really, really striking.  While I get why you might frame it this way, down the center, it doesn''t quite feel right.  You''re also just a hair too far to the right from perfectly down the center, which is a little distracting.  You''re also about 1/2 degree left of vertical and need to rotate it just a touch to the right.  Any of those things fixed I might give this a 9 or 10.  As is it feels "off", but is otherwise a beautiful capture.  7</td>', 'This is really, really striking.  While I get why you might frame it this way, down the center, it doesn''t quite feel right.  You''re also just a hair too far to the right from perfectly down the center, which is a little distracting.  You''re also about 1/2 degree left of vertical and need to rotate it just a touch to the right.  Any of those things fixed I might give this a 9 or 10.  As is it feels "off", but is otherwise a beautiful capture.  7', '2014-07-07 09:01:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7237733, 1120568, 156466, '<td valign="top">Great light, but awkward composition with the horse dead center.</td>', 'Great light, but awkward composition with the horse dead center.', '2014-07-07 09:04:10.000000', NULL, 1),
