(7237768, 1120730, 156466, '<td valign="top">A touch too painterly for me, but gorgeous nonetheless.  I might have been tempted to crop down from the square.  Still a 9.</td>', 'A touch too painterly for me, but gorgeous nonetheless.  I might have been tempted to crop down from the square.  Still a 9.', '2014-07-07 09:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7237769, 1118262, 156466, '<td valign="top">Vertical images make for challenging viewing in this format, and as such make me wonder if there''s a better crop here?  Love the idea, but something feels off.</td>', 'Vertical images make for challenging viewing in this format, and as such make me wonder if there''s a better crop here?  Love the idea, but something feels off.', '2014-07-07 09:44:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7237770, 1120047, 156466, '<td valign="top">Your boosting the sharpness and structure of the Moose needs to be balanced with what it does with the rest of the photo.  Layer masks and control points (depending on software) are your friends here.  As is, you can''t even add blur to fix it because you''ve over-defined your tree trunks. 5 that could have been much more.</td>', 'Your boosting the sharpness and structure of the Moose needs to be balanced with what it does with the rest of the photo.  Layer masks and control points (depending on software) are your friends here.  As is, you can''t even add blur to fix it because you''ve over-defined your tree trunks. 5 that could have been much more.', '2014-07-07 09:49:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7237771, 1120226, 156466, '<td valign="top">Like the idea of the old photo frame look.  A little too much foreground for me.</td>', 'Like the idea of the old photo frame look.  A little too much foreground for me.', '2014-07-07 09:50:33.000000', NULL, 1),
