(7238008, 1120583, 19944, '<td valign="top">A tighter crop would make this a much stronger photo, in my opinion.  I''d like to see more bird, and less fence.</td>', 'A tighter crop would make this a much stronger photo, in my opinion.  I''d like to see more bird, and less fence.', '2014-07-07 16:50:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7238013, 1118250, 19944, '<td valign="top">A lovely portrait, almost like an Old Masters painting, but I can''t say I''m a fan of all of that dead space on each side of her.  I''ll give you a 7, but it probably would have been an 8 or 9 with a tighter crop.</td>', 'A lovely portrait, almost like an Old Masters painting, but I can''t say I''m a fan of all of that dead space on each side of her.  I''ll give you a 7, but it probably would have been an 8 or 9 with a tighter crop.', '2014-07-07 16:54:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7238018, 1120511, 38921, '<td valign="top">Lot''s of potential here with this scene and you did a good job of capturing it.  A couple of things to take it from good to great in my opinion would be:<br/>1. Use a bit of fill flash since the scene is back lit.<br/>2. Get the camera lower.  If the camera was at the eye level of the girl we get to see it at her level and it looks much less like a typical snapshot.</td>', 'Lot''s of potential here with this scene and you did a good job of capturing it.  A couple of things to take it from good to great in my opinion would be:1. Use a bit of fill flash since the scene is back lit.2. Get the camera lower.  If the camera was at the eye level of the girl we get to see it at her level and it looks much less like a typical snapshot.', '2014-07-07 16:56:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7238020, 1118428, 19944, '<td valign="top">I wish I were looking at the front of the bird, and a less of a harsh angle.  <br/> <br/>And, I think you have a little schmutz on your sensor.</td>', 'I wish I were looking at the front of the bird, and a less of a harsh angle.   And, I think you have a little schmutz on your sensor.', '2014-07-07 17:01:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7238025, 1120636, 19944, '<td valign="top">That looks like a really uncomfortable chair to sit in at the beach.</td>', 'That looks like a really uncomfortable chair to sit in at the beach.', '2014-07-07 17:04:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7238026, 1119935, 22288, '<td valign="top">This is a nice image of the bird, but overall the background is so busy it distracts from the picture. Nice sharpness and color.</td>', 'This is a nice image of the bird, but overall the background is so busy it distracts from the picture. Nice sharpness and color.', '2014-07-07 17:05:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7238028, 1120729, 22288, '<td valign="top">I really like the action, the picture has a lot of grain that is distracting and the odd color artifact is a bit distracting.</td>', 'I really like the action, the picture has a lot of grain that is distracting and the odd color artifact is a bit distracting.', '2014-07-07 17:08:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7238029, 1120082, 22288, '<td valign="top">Lots of color and a certain woo effect when viewed for the first time. Not sure what the focal point is? It would be neat if there were a focal point to draw you more into the photo.</td>', 'Lots of color and a certain woo effect when viewed for the first time. Not sure what the focal point is? It would be neat if there were a focal point to draw you more into the photo.', '2014-07-07 17:11:09.000000', NULL, 1),
