(7238056, 1120226, 147314, '<td valign="top">Love the processing of this one, it''s almost a painting in watercolours. Not sure about the border, but still one of my favourites.</td>', 'Love the processing of this one, it''s almost a painting in watercolours. Not sure about the border, but still one of my favourites.', '2014-07-07 17:55:21.000000', NULL, 1),
