(7238133, 1120634, 58634, '<td valign="top">The title really gives this so much more meaning. Although the elephant is considered this huge animal, he really is tiny when in relation to the overall picture (no pun intended). <br/> <br/>Nice shot.</td>', 'The title really gives this so much more meaning. Although the elephant is considered this huge animal, he really is tiny when in relation to the overall picture (no pun intended).  Nice shot.', '2014-07-07 19:43:29.000000', NULL, 1),
