(7238172, 1120524, 58634, '<td valign="top">I like the mid air action going on.</td>', 'I like the mid air action going on.', '2014-07-07 20:01:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7238173, 1119905, 67258, '<td valign="top">A good beakful!  The light seems pretty harsh, but you have controlled the exposure well, with just a little blocking of the shadow area.  A bit of a shame at least one of the feet isn''t visible.  I note there is no sun catch light in the puffin''s eye; I have taken hundreds and hundreds of photos of puffins, and I have noticed the absence in mine, even where I am sure the angle of the sun would result in one - I wonder if it is something to do with the structure of the eye?</td>', 'A good beakful!  The light seems pretty harsh, but you have controlled the exposure well, with just a little blocking of the shadow area.  A bit of a shame at least one of the feet isn''t visible.  I note there is no sun catch light in the puffin''s eye; I have taken hundreds and hundreds of photos of puffins, and I have noticed the absence in mine, even where I am sure the angle of the sun would result in one - I wonder if it is something to do with the structure of the eye?', '2014-07-07 20:05:02.000000', NULL, 1),
