(7238695, 1119676, 7889, '<td valign="top">I am very mean with my 10''s, so much so that this photograph is only the thirteenth 10 I have given out since April 2003. I was going through and voting. When I came to this photograph I just stopped and looked in awe. Not many photographs do that to me. It''s just a wonderful moment frozen in time and captured forever. Any plans to make a print? I would be very interested as I would love this hanging on one of my walls.<br/> <br/></td>', 'I am very mean with my 10''s, so much so that this photograph is only the thirteenth 10 I have given out since April 2003. I was going through and voting. When I came to this photograph I just stopped and looked in awe. Not many photographs do that to me. It''s just a wonderful moment frozen in time and captured forever. Any plans to make a print? I would be very interested as I would love this hanging on one of my walls. ', '2014-07-08 13:48:19.000000', NULL, 0),
