(7238766, 1119975, 60173, '<td valign="top">Awesome clouds! You''ve done a nice job capturing the layers and accenting them just enough, but not too much, with your post-processing.<br/> <br/>It''s funny, when I lived in Indiana, I missed the mountains of the Northwest, because I felt naked and exposed. Not to mention, I got lost all the time, because I couldn''t tell what direction I was facing. Now that I''m in the Northwest again, I miss the flatness, because these damn mountains break up the clouds and they never get to be grand enough to be very interesting! Rawr!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Awesome clouds! You''ve done a nice job capturing the layers and accenting them just enough, but not too much, with your post-processing. It''s funny, when I lived in Indiana, I missed the mountains of the Northwest, because I felt naked and exposed. Not to mention, I got lost all the time, because I couldn''t tell what direction I was facing. Now that I''m in the Northwest again, I miss the flatness, because these damn mountains break up the clouds and they never get to be grand enough to be very interesting! Rawr! ', '2014-07-08 15:22:04.000000', NULL, 0),
