(7239159, 1120607, 77188, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Revecca:</b></div><hr/><i> Really nice composition and pretty colors on your bokeh. The flower could be a bit sharper though. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks!  Yes, sadly the flower isn''t quite in focus.<br/> <br/>We got to this section of the botanical garden so late that we had to rush through it;<br/>too much time spent looking at the bonzai exhibition.  On top of that I was quite unfocused myself,<br/>since it was too warm for my comfort (though I guess I shouldn''t complain since I was told that<br/>back home it was +6°C; we had +29°C).</td>', 'Originally posted by Revecca: Really nice composition and pretty colors on your bokeh. The flower could be a bit sharper though.   Thanks!  Yes, sadly the flower isn''t quite in focus. We got to this section of the botanical garden so late that we had to rush through it;too much time spent looking at the bonzai exhibition.  On top of that I was quite unfocused myself,since it was too warm for my comfort (though I guess I shouldn''t complain since I was told thatback home it was +6°C; we had +29°C).', '2014-07-09 09:58:45.000000', NULL, 0),
